WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
This presentation examines the system
behind AI-enabled quality work.

00:00:04.560 --> 00:00:07.760
We will connect context,
independent evaluation,

00:00:07.806 --> 00:00:11.760
action boundaries, release
decisions and operational feedback.

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:16.000
The architecture covers both
AI-assisted engineering and assurance

00:00:16.027 --> 00:00:19.840
of AI applications. Every
important boundary needs an owner,

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:22.800
a versioned contract
and a failure behavior.

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:26.960
The banking engineering blueprint provides
the more detailed payment implementation

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:30.960
example; this deck develops
the reusable assurance architecture.
